sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Manage profile and preferences
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7
    %% Description: A user saves personal and payment details, states preferred genres and event types in a survey, and later edits preferences and personal information or changes the password.
    actor UP as User (person)
    participant U as User
    participant GE as Genre
    participant ET as EventType

    UP->>U: save name, date of birth, email and address [1]
    UP->>U: save payment details [2]
    UP->>U: fill out survey on preferred genres and event types [3]
    U->>GE: addPreferredBy(user)
    U->>ET: addPreferredBy(user)
    opt later, when something changes [5, 6, 7]
        UP->>U: edit preferences [5]
        U->>GE: updatePreference(user)
        UP->>U: edit personal information, e.g. address [7]
        UP->>U: change password [6]
    end
